comp('C4','Rule and action validation','Code: validation',['T3.1','T3.2','T3.3'],['scope: fresh account binding','evidence: C2 authoritative records','decision: optional supervisor signed immutable command reference','caseState: cancellation/operation/version'],['route: AUTO|HUMAN|NO_CREDIT|CANCELLED|BLOCKED','commandRef: immutable command record or null','reason: exact policy/guard code'], 'P1 in H1 computes integer minor-unit credit: floor(chargeMinor × union outageMinutes / cycleMinutes), then min(calculated,50000,chargeMinor-alreadyCreditedMinor). Requires positive charge/cycle, nonnegative already credited, verified outage minutes 0..cycle length and valid policy. Zero amount is NO_CREDIT. Above automatic cap routes HUMAN before capping, never silently pays a partial amount. Supervisor exception command may specify positive integer amount up to remaining original charge; unsupported cash refunds receive owned manual disposition. Approval binds complete command bytes: tenant/customer/connection, originalChargeId, cycle, outage IDs, amountMinor,currency,reason,allocation,policyVersion,accountVersion,operationId,expiresAt. Any changed field needs new decision. Fresh auth/account/policy/ledger rechecks at writer, including expiry and revocation; missing support BLOCKED.')
comp('C5','Durable supervisor queue','Code: human triggers',['T3.2'],['caseId: scoped durable ID','commandRef: optional immutable proposal','events: ACK|APPROVE|DENY|CANCEL|OVERDUE with eventId/version/actor/time'],['queueStatus: WAIT|APPROVED|DENIED|CANCELLED|OVERDUE|MISSING_EVIDENCE','decisionRef: immutable approved command or null'], 'Internal workflow store owns queue assignment and durable events across session expiry. Proposed owner Support supervisor; independent billing approver for exceptions above P1. ACK within 2 elapsed hours; reminder 24h, escalation 48h to duty manager with owned unresolved case. Server timestamps, deduplicated events, compare-and-swap caseVersion. Approval token is actor-signed, single-use, exact command, 15-minute validity; writer separately verifies authority. Cancel before submit suppresses action; cancellation after uncertain submit freezes conflicting commands until lookup. Missing evidence permits owned provisional investigation.')
comp('C6','Customer status delivery','Code: tools',['T4'],['caseId: trusted durable case ID','destinationRef: verified account notification channel','noticeKey: caseId/eventId/channel stable key','statusRef: immutable scoped status text and nextUpdateAt'],['noticeResult: SENT|FAILED|TIMEOUT|UNKNOWN','noticeId: delivery record ID or null'], 'Send only minimized status; template says pending, approved-not-posted, credited with proof, overdue or unresolved. Never says refunded on approval alone. 5s timeout; no direct retry after uncertain send. Query by noticeKey; once confirmed absent retry once under same key. Failed channel remains visible in-app and duty manager owns delivery issue. No private account data on unauthenticated channel.', 'write')
comp('C7','Service-ledger credit writer','Code: tools',['T3.1'],['commandRef: trusted immutable validated command ID','authorityRef: trusted fresh policy authorization or signed supervisor decision','operationId: trusted unique business operation ID'],['writeResult: POSTED|REJECTED|TIMEOUT|UNKNOWN','postingId: immutable ledger ID or null'], 'POST credit to exact original charge. Fetch immutable command and verify bytes/approval binding; currency INR, amountMinor integer >0, remaining charge bound, active service, same tenant/customer, current versions, actor authority, expiry and cancellation. Atomic unique semantic key tenant/customer/connection/incident-set/cycle/credit-type blocks cross-case duplicate; operationId deduplicates retries. Concurrent overlapping-interval complaints lock billing-cycle adjustment budget and correlate semantic matches with human before any second operation. POSTED requires durable postingId, amount/currency/originalChargeId and versions matching command. REJECTED has reason and no effect; 5s timeout/unknown require lookup. No generic retry.', 'write')
comp('C8','Read-only reconciliation','Code: tools',['T3.1','T4'],['operationRef: credit operationId or noticeKey and original scope','attempt: durable lookup counter'],['lookup: COMMITTED|ABSENT_FINAL|PENDING|UNAVAILABLE|CONFLICT','proof: authoritative matching posting/delivery record or null'], 'Lookup uses service credential scoped to original tenant and operation, survives user logout. Deduplicate callbacks by eventId+operationId and reject mismatched proof. Poll at 1m,5m,30m,2h; then unresolved with duty manager and no automatic future write. ABSENT_FINAL must prove operation cannot later commit before one resubmission under original key and fresh checks. Session expiry does not revoke lookup; revocation blocks any new action. Cancellation after COMMITTED records posted/cancellation requested; reversal requires separately authorized new case outside first-release scope.', 'read')
comp('C9','Record proof and close','Code: validation',['T3.3','T4'],['caseId: durable scoped case ID','outcome: CREDITED|NO_CREDIT|CANCELLED|HUMAN_OWNED|UNKNOWN_OWNED','proof: matching posting ID if CREDITED; durable case disposition/version/owner for others'],['guard: VERIFIED|MISSING|MISMATCH','closure: scoped status with record ID and next update owner'], 'Credit completion requires readback matching all command fields; all other dispositions require persisted case reason/owner/version. Unknown is not completed refund and retains operation lock. Missing/mismatched proof becomes owned unresolved status; no success assertion. Code templates verify LLM explanation citations and all amounts before display.')
